1
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:05,348
But didn't you say Kan
wouldn't wake up until afternoon?

2
00:00:06,904 --> 00:00:11,767
Yeah.
Earth, come on—

3
00:00:12,722 --> 00:00:14,320
Wanna go for a drive with me?

4
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:17,958
A drive? Right now?

5
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:23,537
Yeah. Just let Kan sleep like that, he'll be fine.

6
00:00:23,599 --> 00:00:25,593
I don't think that's a good idea.

7
00:00:25,593 --> 00:00:30,505
It's already 3:30 a.m.
I think you should go home and sleep.

8
00:00:32,399 --> 00:00:33,298
You sure?

9
00:00:34,638 --> 00:00:35,138
Yes.

10
00:00:36,188 --> 00:00:38,466
I've got class tomorrow too.

11
00:00:42,840 --> 00:00:43,680
Thanks.

12
00:00:46,360 --> 00:00:50,482
P'Gun…
P'Gun, we're here.

13
00:00:51,853 --> 00:00:54,335
P'Gun, we're at the room now.

14
00:01:01,570 --> 00:01:07,199
Hey, walk properly.

15
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:18,040
- Ugh…
- P'Gun, wake up.

16
00:01:18,040 --> 00:01:20,604
Don't bother me.

17
00:01:20,604 --> 00:01:22,921
I said wake up, P'Gun.

18
00:01:25,200 --> 00:01:26,737
P'Gun…

19
00:01:26,737 --> 00:01:28,566
Hey—

20
00:01:28,566 --> 00:01:29,748
Ow!

21
00:01:33,439 --> 00:01:37,413
I'm gonna shower.
You can just sleep right there.

22
00:01:38,768 --> 00:01:40,234
Hey—

23
00:02:14,640 --> 00:02:17,000
Maprang…
